{
  "$comment": "BM-2 find-and-change — the pinned task set. Reachable tasks: the scripted novice path is the hub's own advertised find surface (Search row → query → open hit → editor → change → save). Unreachable probes: pi-selector settings that the S2-1 ledger documents as unreachable from the TUI since the /settings override; the probe searches (hub Search row + /settings search subcommand) and records the miss with pane evidence, cross-checked against audit-registry.mjs's machine inventory. Values are pinned so BEFORE/AFTER runs are comparable; scratch UNOWN_HOME per run makes writes disposable.",
